  "ingredients": [
    "3 cups white sugar",
    "1.5 cups butter, softened",
    "5 eggs",
    "3 cups all-purpose flour, sifted",
    "2 tablespoons lemon extract",
    "1 cup lemon-lime carbonated beverage (such as 7Up®)",
    "1 cup sifted confectioners' sugar",
    "0.25 cup milk",
    "0.5 teaspoon vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C). Generously grease a 10-inch fluted tube pan (such as Bundt).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XNjv2DiWJ4jUwpI3foXg8dO8ui0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/234867-7-Up-Cake-ddmfs-035-step1-38b78a84e01b4475962d9bf56058b7b0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/234867/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the cake: Beat white sugar and butter together in a large bowl using an electric mixer until light and fluffy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_NJjSuOfl-4ZxXqdmm_JTae6QQw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/234867-7-Up-Cake-ddmfs-036-step2-037973a0f768449691fe83e3c116ccaa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/234867/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add eggs one at a time, beating well after each addition. Stir in flour, 1 cup at a time, blending well after each addition until batter is smooth; stir in lemon extract. Mix lemon-lime beverage into batter and pour into the prepared pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/39ChDAcZPB1rMwMp8jxpt8T5Pfs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/234867-7-Up-Cake-ddmfs-039-step5-14bf69a5738744caa7c4400979e8a4ed.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/234867/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted in the center of the cake comes out clean, about 1 hour 15 minutes. Remove cake from the pan immediately by placing a wire cooling rack over the base of the cake and inverting the pan to release.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the glaze: Beat confectioners' sugar, milk, and vanilla together in a bowl using an electric mixer on medium until glaze is smooth. Pour glaze over warm cake; let cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eX5_Us8Mtmz27ILdghiibVy26pA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/234867-7-Up-Cake-ddmfs-041-step7-2b1d41823bda48d283be8c5cf253c74c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/234867/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
